# Roles & dashboard access

## Roles

- `admin` — **one account only** (`admin@gmail.com`); full dashboard
- `staff` — operations dashboard (limited)
- `delivery` — driver app only
- `user` — customer

## Staff can access (`/admin` only)

- Dashboard, Orders, Products, Stock, Reviews, Support
- Login always redirects staff straight to `/admin`
- Staff cannot open customer storefront pages

## Staff cannot access

- Customer store / View Store
- Users / role management
- Payments / refunds
- Coupons / CMS
- Delivery assign, Driver Applications
- Settings / role-change password
- Force-mark Delivered (admin QR override) — admin only; requires a logged reason

## Admin user management rules

- Never create a second admin (UI + API)
- Assignable roles only: Customer (`user`), Staff (`staff`), Driver (`delivery`)
- Changing a role requires the **role-change password** from Settings (every time)
- Admin must not edit user identity (name, email, phone) — profile fields are read-only in Edit
- Keep `$0.01` Waafi test pricing unless the user changes it
